== Pre-Bosses ==
Prior to encountering a [[Bosses|boss]], set bonuses from wooden and ore armor will almost exclusively provide additional defense, and accessories will not discriminate by weapon type when giving bonuses. When combined with the general scarcity of weapons and the need to survive, there is little point to sticking to a "class" this early on. For these reasons, players are recommended to make use of whatever they can get their hands on.  Players can acquire a gun or magic weapon early on by smashing one of the Shadow Orbs (in Corruption worlds) or the Crimson Hearts (in Crimson worlds).

