Summoner gear might prove useful to defend against enemies while fishing. A Shield of Cthulhu can be used without interrupting fishing. If you obtained a [[Hotline Fishing Hook]], you don't need to use lava bait anymore. The [[Chum Caster]] is optimal if you are trying to fish up [[Blood Moon]] enemies. The [[Inner Tube]] and [[Mollusk Whistle]] only provide a fishing bonus while in water, and do not stack with one another. For this reason, the [[Mollusk Whistle]] may be preferable due to saving an accessory slot.

